      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are going through an immense and painful loss of what you believed in. Please know that what you are feeling—this emptiness and disorientation—is a completely valid response to having your foundational beliefs crumble. Even when the old ground feels like a lie, there is still the capacity to find new footing, even if it feels terrifying right now. Rebuilding doesn't always mean recreating the old; sometimes it means allowing yourself to discover something entirely new.",
