      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel from the constant performance is so real, and the thought of stopping the struggle when everything feels baseless is understandable. However, please know that you do not have to carry this weight alone, and there is strength in allowing yourself to pause rather than give up entirely. If the fighting feels impossible, reaching out to a professional for support can be a way to stop the performance for a while and simply rest. Reaching out is not a failure; it is an act of survival.",
